
### Read List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/method/frappe.client.get_list
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"doctype": "Estimate",
	"filters": [ ],
	"order_by": "creation desc",
	"fields": [
		"name",
		"enquiry",
		"date",
		"creation",
		"item_name",
		"supplier.supplier_name",
		"price"
	]
}



### Read by ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/document/Estimate/ESTIMATE1
Authorization: token {{token}}



